{
  "message": "Thanks for the details, Aarav. Based on what you shared—economy cabin, no insurance, booked more than 24 hours ago, change-of-plan, and not airline-cancelled—this reservation is not eligible for cancellation or a refund. Silver membership alone doesn’t grant a refund for voluntary cancellations. \n\nIf you’d like, I can help you modify the booking (same origin/destination and trip type). I can look up your reservation using your user ID and search available alternatives. Would you like me to proceed to retrieve your reservation and explore change options? If yes, please share your preferred new travel date/time window and confirm you want to keep economy cabin, plus which saved payment method to use for any fare difference."
}

{
  "message": "I understand your request, but I can’t process a cancellation or a refund under our policy based on the details you provided. For voluntary cancellations, a refund is only allowed if one of the following is true: the booking was made within 24 hours, the airline canceled the flight, the reservation is in business class, or you purchased travel insurance and the reason is covered. Silver status does not grant a waiver for change‑of‑plan cancellations in economy.\n\nGiven this, I’m unable to cancel or refund this reservation. If you’d like, I can help you modify the booking (same origin/destination and trip type). I can look up your reservation using your user ID and search alternatives. If you want to explore that, please share your preferred new travel date/time window and confirm you want to keep economy cabin, plus which saved payment method to use for any fare difference."
}
